[2026-11-09] Passo 1 - parse_int (input.c)
======================================================================
Comando: gcc -Wall -Wextra -std=c99 input.c test_parse.c -o test_parse && ./test_parse
Saida:
[0] -> 0 v=0
[10] -> 0 v=10
[007] -> 0 v=7
[2147483647] -> 0 v=2147483647
[2147483648] -> -1 v=-99
[99999999999999999999] -> -1 v=-99
[-1] -> -1 v=-99
[+3] -> -1 v=-99
[] -> -1 v=-99
[12abc] -> -1 v=-99
[ 5] -> -1 v=-99
[5 ] -> -1 v=-99
